  "2026-07-25T19:14:53.383Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: normal agent help examples now omit redundant --author/--assignee/structured author fields, while exactly one explicit non-agent service override remains documented. Surface measurement fell from 23 occurrences / 561 characters / approximately 141 tokens to 2 occurrences / 67 characters / approximately 17 tokens. Help invariants, token-budget gate, complete suite, and 100% coverage passed."
